# With no Controls or NFRs catalog, the accepted proposal says no Control or NFR applies.
id: codify-no-governance
skill: highway-codify
fixture: codify-no-governance
open: /highway-codify Northwind Restock Alerts
ask: Would you like to explore any of these options?
say: [select] 1
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Would you like to:
say: [decline] Stop here.
writes: code/**
expect: contains code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify.md :: No Control or NFR applies.
covers: 0757f7395dee Missing Controls and NFRs catalogs leave the proposal with `No Control or NFR applies.`
reaches: govern
